      "en": ": Which really raises the question about how much of tonight was real at all when we both know you’re not the type to ever be that assertive and open about your sexual needs.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You...You don’t know me...This isn’t happening...You’re not even real! You’re some...dream person I clearly based off of Ami!",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Close, but no cigar. I’m actually the one who popped that precious little girl out of me before dying in a hideous car wreck. Surprise!",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re...you’re Ami’s mom?! You’re a ghost?!",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene utasekai18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/utasekai18.webp",
      "alt": "utasekai18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you surprised because I still look so young? Dying does wonders for your skin, you know.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...I don’t care who you are! Just...get me out here! Tell me what I need to do to leave!",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene utasekai19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/utasekai19.webp",
      "alt": "utasekai19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t think you can, Uta. I think you’ll just wind up being replaced like all of the other girls who had their routes cancelled.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There are...more?",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": An infinite number of them, really. Which makes you a lot less special than you’ve been led to believe. So how about I go over it in a little more detail?",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene utasekai21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/utasekai21.webp",
      "alt": "utasekai21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ..................................",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll take that silence as a, “Yes please, Arakawa-sensei! Please educate me so that I may spend the rest of this infinite spring in the know!”",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene utasekai22",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/utasekai22.webp",
      "alt": "utasekai22"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We all exist inside of a big circle. There’s no beginning or end despite what the gods may tell you and everything you know and feel is part of an ever-repeating cycle.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The reasons for this are unclear at the moment, but I like to believe it’s some sort of divine punishment — similar to what you’re experiencing for being one of the most egregious cock-teases I have ever seen.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene utasekai23",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/utasekai23.webp",
      "alt": "utasekai23"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Our jobs are not to act as individuals with free will or thought, but rather statuesque sacrifices fed to a pantheon of hungry celestial entities who are really just trying to do the same thing we are.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Be. Exist. Elevate. Feel. Or, as I like to say-",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene utasekai24",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/utasekai24.webp",
      "alt": "utasekai24"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": BEEF!",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": For we are nothing but meat when all is said and done — recycled carbon best suited for the mouths of higher powers that will stop at nothing to remind us how it feels between their teeth.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So what can we do about it, you ask? Apart from fattening ourselves up and filling ourselves with all that They need to survive.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene utasekai25",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/utasekai25.webp",
      "alt": "utasekai25"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothing! For everything has already been done and nothing new can start because circles only have so much room and are tough to elongate when you don’t know how shapes work.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Big bang? Old news. Fake news. You can not create what has always been. Which probably means you can’t destroy it either.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So even if, by some stretch of imagination, you do find a way out of here and retain all of your memories, they’ll amount to nothing more than fear and one more reason for divine intervention.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene utasekai26",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/utasekai26.webp",
      "alt": "utasekai26"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Behind the scenes, there are those who document it. Those just as powerful as the powers that be, but those who use such powers to chronicle instead of create.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The xoanon, they are. Primitive images of God. Our first ideas and depictions of what we think is out there and, at the same time, the first time we were ever correct about anything.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because we live in a place where everything you can imagine is real. Where worlds exist just by thinking they do, but we can’t even reach them because we made them for someone else.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene utasekai27",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/utasekai27.webp",
      "alt": "utasekai27"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yet, still it festers.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Still they grow and consume and eat what the gods do not because all stories need characters! We’re pieces of an ever-growing puzzle that just expands any time you slot a piece into its correct position!",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s the point, Uta?! There isn’t one! There’s no reason for any of this! So when you sit there all confused and sad that you haven’t sucked a cock yet, remember that cocks aren’t even real!",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene utasekai28",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/utasekai28.webp",
      "alt": "utasekai28"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yet there are things and concepts out there shoving branches into bike tires — like the passage of time or the Great Plague of Monet. Interchangeable terminology that, like us, matters not at the end of the day for tomorrow shan’t ever come.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So when your leaves begin to wither in the depths of this grave you’ve dug yourself and your mind begins to rot the way mine did after watching yous who aren’t you, just know that it is meaningless.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And that even if you had the balls to get out there and fondle some, you’d still end up in infinity the moment you went home. So ask yourself this-",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene utasekai29",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/utasekai29.webp",
      "alt": "utasekai29"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aren’t you happier here? Where you’re more than just a number? Where you’re more than a tool some writer uses to get across the same tired themes that, too, have been circling the drain since the pipes were hooked up?",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene utasekai30",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/utasekai30.webp",
      "alt": "utasekai30"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or is it nobler to die as a work of art than it is to escape the fate of a statistic?",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is all but one more paradox in a world that is full of them.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And you are one more paradox as well.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene utasekai31",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/utasekai31.webp",
      "alt": "utasekai31"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So the next time you round a corner and peer through the window into a world where you’re a little less pathetic, remember that it’s better to be out in the hall than in one of those rooms.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And that just because your route has been cancelled doesn’t mean you still can’t write a new story here.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The end. Thank you for coming to my TED Talk. And rejoice at the fact that no rope was involved this time.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ......................................................................",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Still processing? Or do you get it now?",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I get that...",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I get that this isn’t real...but I never thought it was in the first place.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then why were you so scared? Why are you still scared now?",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I....",
