    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s because being scared is all you know.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And it’s all you’ll ever know if you don’t act soon.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Consider yourself Sekai-ed.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Now, go make yourself important.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Help lay me to rest.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
